  "body": "**What happens:** `origin/main` fails to compile: `crates/app/src/warned_moves.rs:23` error E0004, non-exhaustive patterns, `Warning::HolderHit` not covered. Found by the review of PR #455.\n\n**Cause:** two of today's merges that each passed on their own: PR #454 (#349, warned moves) added `warned_moves::moves_named`, which matches every `verify::Warning` variant, and PR #395 (#369, lathe holder bodies) added `Warning::HolderHit { at, part, short_mm }`.\n\n**Fix:** `HolderHit` names one move (`at`), like `FixtureHit`, so it joins the single-move arm.\n\n**Done means:** `cargo build -p camcraft-app` and `-p camcraft-ui` compile on main; `warned_moves` tests pass, plus a test that a `HolderHit` marks its move.\n",
